Job Overview

We are looking for a motivated ReactJS Trainee to join our development team. The candidate will work with experienced developers to build responsive and user-friendly web applications using ReactJS and modern JavaScript technologies.

Key Responsibilities

Assist in developing web applications using ReactJS.
Write clean, efficient, and reusable code.
Work with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to build UI components.
Collaborate with senior developers and designers to implement new features.
Debug and troubleshoot issues in web applications.
Participate in code reviews and team meetings.
Learn and follow best practices for front-end development.
Required Skills

Basic knowledge of JavaScript, HTML, and CSS.
Understanding of ReactJS fundamentals (components, props, state).
Familiarity with ES6 concepts.
Basic knowledge of Git is a plus.
Good problem-solving and learning attitude.
Preferred Qualifications

Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, IT, or related field.
Knowledge of Bootstrap / Tailwind / Material UI is a plus.
Understanding of REST APIs is an advantage.
What We Offer

Hands-on training with real projects.
Guidance from experienced developers.
Opportunity to grow into a ReactJS Developer role.
